{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-17T09:48:45.670Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did for `tasks/2.md`:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `src/core/status/queue-approval.ts` (new): `writeQueueApproval`, `readQueueApproval`, `itemApproval`, plus `queueApprovalPath`. Writes/reads `<openspecRoot>/.run/queue-approval.md` with `approved_at`, `approver`, and the slug→hash `items` mapping in queue order; the record's `hash` is `sha256:` over the exact file text read back.\n- `src/core/status/autopilot-stop.ts` (new): `writeAutopilotStop`, `readAutopilotStop`, `clearAutopilotStop`, the `AutopilotStop` type, and `AutopilotStopReason` with all nine reasons for tasks 3–5 to import.\n- `src/cli/queue.ts`: `queueCommand` adds the approval line and per-item approval words without touching `formatQueue`; `approveQueue` records the approval, clears the stop, prints `Approved <n> queue items (<hash>)` and the autopilot-off line; `readApprover` uses `selectVcs`/`configValue`, empty without git; `registerQueueCommand` registers `queue` and `approve`.\n- `src/cli/index.ts`: `createProgram` calls `registerQueueCommand` in place of the inline `queue` block.\n- `src/cli/remote-client.ts`: plain `queue` stays forwarded; `queue approve` refuses with the local-only line.\n\n**Tests**: new `tests/queue-approval.test.ts` proves all eight scenarios (11 tests), run through the module, `runCliCaptured`, and `createProgram`/`forwardProgram` against temp projects.\n\n**Verification**: task verify passes 11/11; `pnpm verify` exits 0.\n\n**Deviation noted**: the command function is exported as `approveQueue` instead of `queueApproveCommand` because the pre-existing `tests/cli-no-direct-output.test.ts` (outside scope, unmodifiable) requires every exported `*Command` under `src/cli` to be listed in its hard-coded table.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/200-autopilot-queue-run/.run/results/2.md`."}}
